null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiY0_6RsteWAxU9ePUHHUPnLNgQ3YcHCJ4BKAA"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiY0_6RsteWAxU9ePUHHUPnLNgQ3IcHCJ0BKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_30_TO_60_MIN"],"30 到 60 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiY0_6RsteWAxU9ePUHHUPnLNgQ3YcHCKABKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiY0_6RsteWAxU9ePUHHUPnLNgQ3IcHCJ8BKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["26_0514_1530\n\n採先付款、後排隊的制度。平日下午大約等了 40 分鐘，不過不需要一直留在現場，店家會提供預估時間，整體流程算完善，這點給好評。\n\n這次選了硬麵，湯頭屬於非常濃厚、偏日本重鹹口味。\n\n（補充，我的口味極度日式，非常喜歡重鹹油）\n但豚骨湯底我覺得偏死鹹沒有層次感，而且表面的豬油沒有完全融化，猜測可能和湯溫不夠高有關。不過值得稱讚的是，沒有明顯豬腥味。\n\n配料份量很多，肉、蛋、筍都給得算大方，這點是優點。但配料溫度偏低，甚至有些接近冰的狀態，配料泡進湯裡後，吃不到一半整碗就變成溫湯，影響很大，也讓後半段吃起來特別膩。\n\n麵條是粗麵，不是我個人偏好的極細麵類型。\n加點的米飯煮的有到水準，好評。\n\n老闆態度很熱情，也會頻繁詢問是否需要加麵，不過因為後面湯已經冷掉了，所以沒有再加。\n\n整體來說，性價比其實不錯，價格算便宜，但口味和細節沒有特別打中我，回訪機率不高。\n\n建議將配料溫度改善\n以及拉麵碗燙熱，解決湯頭溫度問題。",null,[0,77]]]],[null,1779116759000000,1779116759000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfU2oySjBSM0VwWW1QYVU0aUU5Ny0xUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfU2oySjBSM0VwWW1QYVU0aUU5Ny0xURoSQ2dzSTE5V3MwQVlRcksyMWF3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiY0_6RsteWAxU9ePUHHUPnLNgQ_2MIoQEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6168209519588645144/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVmxWc1pHdGxTRm8wVTFoU2JGb3hSa1pWVkZwWFpWWkNVVlF3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6168209519588645144/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVmxWc1pHdGxTRm8wVTFoU2JGb3hSa1pWVkZwWFpWWkNVVlF3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6168209519588645144/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHVmxWc1pHdGxTRm8wVTFoU2JGb3hSa1pWVkZwWFpWWkNVVlF3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/loc